ns. In week 1 of the 2025 season, he notched four receptions for 85 yards and two touchdowns in a victory against UMass. In week 10, Clarke brought in a career-long 50-yard reception in an overtime victory versus Tulsa. He finished the 2025 season hauling in 30 passes for 483 yards and six touchdowns."}]}}